author=stealth
description=Zygisk module. Hides root, Magisk, KSU, APatch, Zygisk, LSPosed, Frida, Xposed, Riru, Shamiko, SELinux, busybox from apps. Device spoofing with Play Integrity support. Kernel, CPU, mounts, maps, environ, net/unix, SELinux context, getauxval spoofing. Ptrace blocking. Auto-detects apps with root access and exempts them. No GUI — everything enabled by default.
minMagisk=24000
